# CI/CD & Environments

- Separate development / staging|preview / production configs, secrets, and data.
- Prefer promoting the same artifact across envs.
- Minimum gates: install (lockfile), lint/types, tests, build; optional secret/vuln scan.
- Document rollback; prefer expand/migrate/contract for schema changes.
- Do not casually rewrite CI/prod secrets; “deployed” requires evidence.

Korean rationale: `docs/pvc-guide/ko/devops/ci-cd.md`
